  60          /**
  61           * @brief       send command table to lcm interface.
  62           * @param       cmdTbl = [in] command table.
  63           * @retval      return = SUCCESS or FAIL.
  64           * @see
  65           * @author      Matt Wang
  66           * @since       2008-06-16
  67           * @todo        N/A
  68           * @bug         N/A
